            "title": "Glass pool fences",
            "text": "<p>Backyard pools are common across Dallas, Houston and San Antonio subdivisions. A glass pool fence keeps the view across the yard while separating the pool from the patio. Most cities apply the 48\" barrier rule, so the 46\" panel is the usual choice, with gate hardware for the opening.</p>"
          }
        },
