          "settings": {
            "title": "Balconies and view decks",
            "text": "<p>Two-story homes in DFW and Houston often have a second-floor balcony over the patio. Hill Country lots around Austin and San Antonio come with raised view decks. A 36\" or 42\" frameless glass deck railing keeps the sightline open. Side-mount spigots on the fascia save floor space on narrow balconies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
